+# Agent Note: Root-scoped right panel tabs
+
+Status: implemented
+
+English | [中文](2026-09-08-root-right-panel-tabs.zh.md)
+
+## Problem
+
+Extensions that observe work across Sessions need a visible home before a Session exists. The native details slot belongs to the selected Session and replacing it removes tool inspection.
+
+## Decision
+
+The layout declares an additive root-scoped `shell.panel` slot and renders its labeled entries beside native tool details. The first extension opens on desktop entry unless browser storage records a collapsed preference. Native open-details actions select tool inspection; an absent selected extension falls back to another extension or closes the pane.
+
+## Alternatives considered
+
+Replacing the Session details occupant couples an extension to native feature components. An overlay obscures conversation content. A root-scoped tab keeps both owners independent while reusing the column geometry.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Panel visibility survives reload, but width and selected tab do not. Storage failure falls back to initial viewport behavior. Closing or selecting a tab changes only viewing state; extension work needs its own authorization and lifecycle. Component checks cover initialization, stored collapse, native selection and registration removal; browser checks cover the assembled entry.
